							<small class="font-mono text-[0.5rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-paper-deep">Home owns</small>
							<strong class="mt-2 block text-xl">Your agentic environment</strong>
							<p class="mb-0 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/45">composition · domain Assets · continuity</p>
						</article>
						<article class="p-5">
							<small class="font-mono text-[0.5rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-white/40">Targets deliver</small>
							<strong class="mt-2 block text-xl">Application · API · Docs</strong>
							<p class="mb-0 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/45">products · history · delivery</p>
						</article>
					</div>
					<p class="mx-[clamp(1.25rem,4vw,3.25rem)] mt-5 max-w-[48rem] text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/40">
						GSD, BMAD, Spec Kit, Superpowers, Ponytail, Slack, and GitHub are
						shown as familiar examples of methods or utilities—not qualified
						Hairness integrations.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="border-b border-line py-[clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem)]">
