							Adopt an environment,<br />
							<em class="font-editorial font-normal text-copper">not a pile of Skills.</em>
						</h2>
					</header>
					<div class="grid border-t border-line-strong md:grid-cols-3">
						{homes.map(([name, contents]) => (
							<article class="border-b border-line p-[clamp(1.25rem,3vw,2rem)] md:border-r md:last:border-r-0">
								<p class="m-0 font-mono text-[0.5rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-copper">
									Concept · Not installable yet
								</p>
								<h3 class="mt-5 mb-2 text-2xl tracking-[-0.04em]">{name}</h3>
