					<p class="mx-[clamp(1.25rem,4vw,3.25rem)] mt-12 mb-0 max-w-[48rem] text-[clamp(2rem,4.5vw,4rem)] leading-[1.04] font-semibold tracking-[-0.055em]">
						If your agents had a Home,
						<em class="font-editorial font-normal text-copper">what would yours be built for?</em>
					</p>
				</section>

				<section class="bg-copper px-[clamp(1.25rem,4vw,3.25rem)] py-[clamp(5.5rem,11vw,8rem)] text-white" id="start">
					<div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_0.85fr] md:items-end">
						<div>
							<p class="m-0 text-[0.6rem] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/60">
